{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は早起きしたので\n1日がながくかんじてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて！今日のお仕事がおわったいま！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにしようかな～と思ったところ\nブログを書こうと思い書いてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は1日みなみちゃんと同じテーブルに\n座ってたのですが、\n一つの現場ではおとなりに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう一つの現場ではお向かいさんに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横から見ても正面から見てもかわいい\nみなみちゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！朝一番にあったのは花奈さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝からはっぴー(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみちゃんと花奈さん尽くしの\n私得な1日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみちゃんも花奈さんも仲良くしてくれるから結構毎日、かなりの確率で私得なんだけどね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/03/06/0093564/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/03/06/0093564/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びよーーーーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/03/06/0093564/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急な告知ですが！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このあと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"21時30分～21時55分まで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NHK  Eテレさんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「趣味どきっ！明日使える！お弁当大百科」に出演します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人で外番組にでるのが\nすごーく緊張して\nきっといつもよりカチコチな私だと思うけど\nぜひ、みてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、明日のお弁当にぜひ使ってください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/03/06/0093564/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にもいろいろな告知がありますが\nまとめ次第ブログにかきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、先日は握手会のありがとうございました！\nたくさんの方があいにきてくださりとても嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話題的には、\nバースデーライブのこと\nあさひなぐの舞台のこと\nそして、もーこと仲良しなんだね！\nという話題が多かったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会おわってすぐに、\nもーこの話題多かったよ～！ってメールしたら\n喜んでました(｡・・｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいな、もーこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/03/06/0093564/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.4.5部の服！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/03/06/0093564/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"}